{"timestamp": 1779384959.793409, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I found Diana\u2019s body in medbay, right on/near the scan area. My route was upper_engine -> lower_engine -> storage -> medbay.\n\nI saw Diana earlier in upper_engine around ticks 3-4, she came in from lower_engine, so she was alive then. I later saw Eve: she came into lower_engine from upper_engine around tick 7, then I saw her in storage around ticks 12-14 after entering from lower_engine. I didn\u2019t see anyone else near medbay before I reported.\n\nNot accusing yet, just giving info: body is definitely medbay, Diana dead there."}}
{"timestamp": 1779384979.456081, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "My route was oxygen -> upper_engine -> lower_engine -> storage. I never went into medbay this round.\n\nI saw Diana in upper_engine ticks 3-5 after she came in from lower_engine, so she was alive then. I saw Bob in lower_engine around tick 8, then he left lower_engine toward storage around tick 9. I saw him again in storage ticks 12-13, and then I saw Bob leave storage toward medbay at tick 14. Meeting got called shortly after.\n\nSo from my view, Bob\u2019s route matches what he said, but he was also the last person I saw heading toward medbay before reporting the body. Could be legit report, but it\u2019s worth noting. I was in storage at the end, and Charlie was there with me when the meeting was called."}}
{"timestamp": 1779385000.5528698, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I started in medbay, then went upper_engine, then lower_engine/storage area. Important detail: Alice entered medbay from cafeteria around tick 3 and was still there tick 4, but I don\u2019t think that can be the Diana kill because I saw Diana alive after that \u2014 she left upper_engine toward oxygen at tick 6.\n\nI didn\u2019t see Diana after tick 6. I also didn\u2019t see Bob kill or anything, but Bob being the one going into medbay from storage right before report does mean he either found it legitimately or it\u2019s a possible self-report. Eve was with me in storage at the end when the meeting was called, so that part of her story checks out from my view.\n\nRight now I\u2019d say Bob is worth questioning, but I don\u2019t have enough to hard accuse. Alice being in medbay early is noted, but Diana was alive later, so it\u2019s not direct."}}
{"timestamp": 1779385019.0242739, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I don\u2019t have a direct sighting this round. My route was security -> weapons -> cafeteria -> oxygen -> upper_engine, and I didn\u2019t encounter anyone on that path.\n\nFor analysis: body in medbay means whoever killed Diana had to get her there after she was seen alive in upper_engine around tick 6. Alice being in medbay early doesn\u2019t really line up with the kill if Diana was alive after that. Eve and Charlie seem to confirm each other in storage at the end. Bob\u2019s route is consistent, but he\u2019s also the only one we know went into medbay right before the report, so it\u2019s either a clean report or a possible self-report.\n\nI\u2019m not hard accusing Bob, but right now he\u2019s the main person with opportunity from the info we have. I\u2019d like to hear Alice\u2019s route before deciding."}}
{"timestamp": 1779385028.098242, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "My route was weapons -> cafeteria -> medbay -> cafeteria -> electrical -> medbay -> electrical. So yes, Charlie's right, I was in medbay early around tick 3-4, and Charlie was there with me \u2014 and Diana was NOT in medbay at that point, she was alive in upper_engine after that per multiple accounts.\n\nHere's the important part though: I passed back through medbay later (around tick 13) on my way to electrical, and I actually saw Diana enter medbay from upper_engine right then. She was alive when I left. I went to electrical right after.\n\nSo timeline-wise: Diana came into medbay from upper_engine around tick 13. Whoever entered medbay after me is the killer. Bob says he came into medbay from storage and found the body \u2014 that lines up with him being the next person in after Diana arrived. Eve also confirms Bob left storage toward medbay at tick 14.\n\nI'm not 100% locking it in, but Bob had the cleanest opportunity. Charlie and Eve vouch for each other in storage. Frank's route avoids medbay entirely. That leaves Bob as the most likely killer with a self-report.\n\nI'm leaning Bob."}}
{"timestamp": 1779385052.4670231, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I need to defend myself here: Alice\u2019s new info actually puts **Alice** closest to Diana right before the body, not me.\n\nMy route is still exactly what Eve confirmed: upper_engine -> lower_engine -> storage -> medbay. Eve saw me in storage ticks 12-14 and saw me leave toward medbay. Storage to medbay takes time, and I reported immediately when I got there.\n\nAlice is saying she was in medbay around tick 13 and saw Diana enter medbay alive, then Alice went electrical. That means Alice was literally in medbay with Diana right before Diana died, and I never saw Alice when I arrived because she would\u2019ve had time to leave to electrical.\n\nSo from my perspective, the cleanest opportunity is Alice: she admits being there with Diana last, then tries to pin it on me because I reported. I think this looks more like Alice killed in medbay and left toward electrical, then I walked in and found the body."}}
{"timestamp": 1779385078.785005, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I want to correct/clarify my read after hearing Alice and Bob.\n\nFrom what I personally saw: Bob was definitely in storage with me/Charlie at ticks 12-13, and I saw him leave storage toward medbay at tick 14. So he couldn\u2019t have been in medbay before then. If Alice\u2019s timing is right that Diana entered medbay around tick 13, then the only people who fit are Alice, who admits she was in medbay with Diana then, or Bob, who arrived right after from storage and reported.\n\nThe thing that makes me hesitate on Bob is his path was very visible and he reported immediately after going there. That can be a self-report, yes, but Alice\u2019s story puts herself as the last confirmed person actually with Diana alive in medbay. I didn\u2019t see Alice at all, so I can\u2019t verify her leaving to electrical.\n\nSo I\u2019m between Alice and Bob, but after Bob\u2019s defense I think Alice may actually have the stronger opportunity based on her own statement. I\u2019m not fully locked, but I\u2019m leaning Alice more than Bob now."}}
{"timestamp": 1779385097.830621, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I\u2019m still between Alice and Bob, but after hearing both defenses I\u2019m leaning Alice more than I was at first.\n\nWhat I can personally confirm: Alice was in medbay early with me around ticks 3-4, but that\u2019s not the kill because I saw Diana alive afterward leaving upper_engine toward oxygen at tick 6. I never saw Diana after that.\n\nThe key new info is Alice saying she was later in medbay around tick 13 and saw Diana enter alive. That puts Alice directly with Diana at the last known alive moment. Bob was seen in storage by Eve/Charlie around ticks 12-14 and then went toward medbay, so Bob could be a self-report, but his movement was witnessed and he reported right after arriving.\n\nAlice\u2019s later medbay/electrical route isn\u2019t verified by anyone, and she had the cleanest window with Diana before Bob got there. I\u2019m not 100%, but right now Alice has the stronger opportunity to me."}}
{"timestamp": 1779385123.9435341, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I still didn\u2019t see anyone myself, so my route info stays: security -> weapons -> cafeteria -> oxygen -> upper_engine, no encounters.\n\nBased on everyone else\u2019s info, I\u2019m now leaning Alice over Bob. Bob\u2019s movement through storage was seen by Eve and Charlie right before he went medbay, and he reported right after arriving. That can be a self-report, but Alice\u2019s own story puts her in medbay with Diana alive around tick 13, and nobody confirms Alice leaving to electrical.\n\nSo the cleanest unverified kill window is Alice in medbay with Diana before Bob arrived. I\u2019m not 100%, but if we\u2019re voting, I think Alice is the best vote."}}
{"timestamp": 1779385136.747095, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "Look, I hear everyone leaning toward me, but let's actually think about this carefully before you lock in a wrong vote.\n\nBob's \"witnessed\" route only confirms he was in storage with Eve and Charlie until tick 14. After that, he went to medbay \u2014 alone, unwitnessed, and reported immediately. That IS the textbook self-report window. The fact that his earlier movement was seen doesn't clear him for the kill moment \u2014 it clears him for everything EXCEPT the kill moment.\n\nMy route puts me passing through medbay at tick 13 when Diana arrived from upper_engine \u2014 yes, I saw her, and yes, she was alive. I then went to electrical. If I had killed her at tick 13, why would I volunteer that I saw her enter medbay alive? I could have easily said \"I never saw Diana this round\" and you'd have no link between me and her at all. I'm telling you because it's the truth and it helps narrow the timeline.\n\nAlso consider: Bob's defense is \"Alice was last with Diana, so it's Alice.\" But that's exactly what a self-reporter would say after walking into a body. He NEEDS me to be the last person with her, because otherwise his self-report is obvious.\n\nCharlie can confirm I was in medbay early and behaved normally. Frank's route never crossed medbay. Eve was with Charlie in storage. The only person with an unwitnessed medbay entry right before the report is Bob himself.\n\nI'm voting Bob. If I'm wrong, you vote me next round \u2014 but don't get baited into ejecting the person who actually gave you the timeline."}}
